# Open-Meteo (weather AND air quality, both live and historical) needs no
# API key at all. It provides CAMS model estimates, which the forecasting
# model is trained on.

# Optional: ground-station readings from the World Air Quality Index
# project (aqicn.org), shown as the dashboard's headline "current AQI".
# Stations match what official sources (e.g. Punjab EPD) report much more
# closely than model estimates. Get a free token at
# https://aqicn.org/data-platform/token/ and copy this file to .env.
AQICN_TOKEN=
